%%body
{
  A trail was an understatement, as you stand before the massive box of a structure, you could only wonder what was inside.

    @ Nori "Despite its appearance, it is a massive mine the Maphir were apparently using to extract large quantities of ore."

  Ore, like general materials?

    @ Nori "Indeed, but it had been exhausted, oddly enough, I followed the Radio Tower's signals to this very location and several similar sites."

  All it meant was the mines had something in them of interest.

    @ Nori "Precisely, something even to set off the old Radio Tower."

  Which meant it was magical in nature.

  Trying to find your way inside the structure, the doors wouldn't budge and none of your access cards were working as it seemed the structure was powered down.

    @ Nori "It's been defunct for some time now, access cards likely wouldn't work."

  Should have told you that before you wasted your time.

    @ Nori "There should be several maintenance ducts that you could enter from, granted those ducts were meant to withstand the use and abuse of heavy mining equipment, so don't expect it to be easy."

  In other words, pack a good crowbar.
}
%date 2026-07-31, 2026-08-04
